ut_ actually triggering change detection.\r\n\r\n## What solution would you like?\r\n\r\nAn API exposed for these type e.g. `get_untracked()` or something like that which returns a `&mut T` to the inner type but does not cause `is_changed()` to return true.\r\n\r\n## What alternative(s) have you considered?\r\n\r\nUsing unsafe primitives `UnsafeCell`, or wrapping them in something like a `Mutex` to get mutable access immutably. However, these are quite a bit overkill and add unnecessary `unsafe` and overhead.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2348/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2348/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5074038921,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDUwNzQwMzg5MjE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/events/5074038921","actor":{"login":"ostwilkens","id":5286600,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODY2MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5286600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens","html_url":"https://github.com/ostwilkens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ostwilkens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"refe